<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - TERA COMPUTER RATED BUY.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - TERA COMPUTER RATED BUY.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Salomon Brothers said analyst John Jones initiated coverage of supercomputer maker Tera Computer Co with a buy rating.</p>
<p>-- said large computers are &quot;alive and well once again in the computer industry&quot; and Tera should be the beneficiary of this renewed focus on high-end systems.</p>
<p>-- has $12-to-$14 12-month price target on stock.</p>
<p>-- shares were up 1-1/16 to 6-9/16.</p>
</text>
